# The eval/train corpora are checksum-verified byte-for-byte (scripts/verify.py,
# data/checksums.json). Windows' default core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF -> CRLF on
# checkout, which flips the checksum without touching a single character of content.
# Force these files untouched on every platform.
*.jsonl -text
*.safetensors filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
